  "location": "36 CFR parts 702, 704; 37 CFR part 302",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Library of Congress: 5 references to U.S. Code sections repealed, omitted or not in the Code",
      "summary": "In the CFR chapters assigned to the Library of Congress, 5 references in 4 sections cite a U.S. Code section that release point 119-134 of the U.S. Code does not carry in force: 4 cite a repealed section; 1 cites a number the Code does not have. The release names no successor for these sections.",
      "impact": "A reader who follows these references does not reach the text the rule relies on. No effect on a decision or an amount has been established.",
      "correction": "The agency decides whether to remove or replace each reference. The U.S. Code names no successor for these sections."
    }
  },
